WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:02,050
Zhang Yisi hid a large amount of materials

2
00:00:02,050 --> 00:00:03,610
As long as I let the news out

3
00:00:03,610 --> 00:00:05,010
There are hundreds of residents in the building

4
00:00:05,010 --> 00:00:06,210
Let me see what you do

5
00:00:06,210 --> 00:00:09,150
Dear neighbors

6
00:00:09,150 --> 00:00:10,950
Someone is in a snowstorm

7
00:00:10,950 --> 00:00:12,270
Read the danger and warm the blue furnace

8
00:00:12,270 --> 00:00:13,910
Adequate food and electricity

9
00:00:13,910 --> 00:00:15,030
Just care about your own life

10
00:00:15,030 --> 00:00:16,190
Extremely selfish

11
00:00:16,190 --> 00:00:17,430
Everyone, take a look

12
00:00:17,430 --> 00:00:20,270
It was more than 70 degrees below zero and we were hungry

13
00:00:20,270 --> 00:00:22,190
He lives comfortably at home

14
00:00:22,190 --> 00:00:23,230
Is it fair?

15
00:00:23,230 --> 00:00:26,270
Let’s discuss together why we hate supplies.

16
00:00:28,510 --> 00:00:30,670
It was over 70 degrees below zero and he was wearing pajamas in his room.

17
00:00:30,750 --> 00:00:32,870
Where does the fuel come from to avoid dew and heat?

18
00:00:32,870 --> 00:00:34,430
Continuous power supply all night long

19
00:00:34,430 --> 00:00:36,390
How many resources has he hoarded?

20
00:00:36,390 --> 00:00:38,670
Is the video shot recently?

21
00:00:38,670 --> 00:00:41,790
I can’t believe that some people can live so comfortably in the last days

22
00:00:41,790 --> 00:00:44,070
I guarantee that the videos were all shot recently

23
00:00:44,070 --> 00:00:46,870
Zhang Yi stocked up a large amount of food and fuel in advance

24
00:00:46,870 --> 00:00:50,070
Home is as comfortable as heaven

25
00:00:50,070 --> 00:00:51,310
I can testify

26
00:00:51,310 --> 00:00:52,710
I was the one who helped him make large quantities

27
00:00:52,710 --> 00:00:53,950
Moving purchased supplies

28
00:00:53,950 --> 00:00:55,150
Everyone should still have an impression
